  "description": "Jeong-Hyeon’s life falls into utter ruin after losing his apartment and all his belongings in a fire. Plagued by extreme misfortune and erotic dreams about his close friend Jin, Jeong-Hyeon discovers a shocking truth: his good luck is being drained away whenever they are apart. However, physical contact with Jin slowly restores his stolen luck, with greater intimacy proving even more effective. Forced to stay close to Jin to escape his relentless bad luck, Jeong-Hyeon must navigate their changing dynamic and intense physical encounters to reclaim his normal life.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
